# Base URL of the FastAPI backend. Server-side only -- no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix,
# so it is never inlined into the browser bundle. Server Components and route
# handlers reach the API directly; the browser never talks to it.
#
# Read at module scope from the real process environment, never baked into the
# image -- which is what lets one build serve any environment. In production this
# is the API's own hostname (api.<domain>), not the storefront's.
API_URL=http://localhost:8000
